{"version":1,"content":"<p>加拿大流行天王The Weeknd於啟德體育園舉行的《After Hours til Dawn Tour》香港站演出，昨晚（30日）隆重迎來第3場演出。</p><p>現場除了吸引滿場歌迷外，包廂席同樣星光熠熠，其中影帝梁朝偉亦親臨現場支持！</p><p>偉仔早前已私下</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-01T03:38:13.726124+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-31T01:01:04+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-01T03:59:24.875219+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-01T03:30:42.064371+00:00","content_hash":"53a0b90d4a37c646c58a04f370eb592a59f6f2973641dedbcf82562779c24ae4","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}